1
00:00:00,404 --> 00:00:02,434
(Howard:)And whistles.

2
00:00:03,808 --> 00:00:07,678
(Bernadette:)At any point did it dawn on you to talk
to me about spending this kind of money?

3
00:00:08,646 --> 00:00:10,776
(Howard:)It's kind of dawning on me now.

4
00:00:11,949 --> 00:00:13,939
(Bernadette:)I don't believe you.

5
00:00:14,118 --> 00:00:16,948
(Bernadette:)Howie, we can't afford to waste money
on junk like this.

6
00:00:17,121 --> 00:00:20,611
(Howard:)What are you talking about?
We make plenty of money.

7
00:00:20,791 --> 00:00:23,691
(Bernadette:)I make plenty of money.
You make peanuts.

8
00:00:24,362 --> 00:00:27,162
Well, yes, but we're married now.

9
00:00:27,632 --> 00:00:31,232
(Howard:)That means when you get sick,
I take care of you.

10
00:00:31,435 --> 00:00:34,135
(Howard:)And when you make a bunch of money...

11
00:00:34,305 --> 00:00:36,465
(Howard:)...I get to buy stuff.

12
00:00:38,342 --> 00:00:42,712
(Howard:)Sorry if you don't like it,
but that's how love works.

13
00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:46,680
(Bernadette:)No. Here's how love works.
You're gonna return the machine...

14
00:00:46,851 --> 00:00:50,481
...or you could print out a working set
of lady parts and sleep with those.

15
00:00:52,356 --> 00:00:55,086
(Bernadette:)Oh, my God.
Are you actually thinking about it?

16
00:00:58,963 --> 00:01:02,053
(Penny:)I don't understand.
Why didn't you just tell Kripke the truth?

